## Context
The counter rules of ADR-008 in one place: rates from actual elapsed time, reset detection, `WarmingUp` on the first sample, no subtraction across a generation change, the 250 ms boottime versus monotonic suspend check, and the stale threshold. Every E04 sampler uses these helpers, and E05 uses them for per-process rates. Sources: ADR-008 (tick semantics, counter rules, stale threshold, suspend signal 2), R-051, PERF-022 (via R-051), ADR-003 (`SampleFlags`, `Validity`).

## Deliverable
